  "instructions": [
    "Rinse the bulgur in a fine mesh sieve and drain well.",
    "In a large copper pot, bring 2 cups of water to a boil.",
    "Add the bulgur to the pot, cover, and reduce heat to low.",
    "Simmer for 10 minutes or until the water is absorbed and the bulgur is tender.",
    "Fluff the bulgur with a fork and let it cool.",
    "In a large bowl, combine the cooled bulgur, parsley, mint, scallions, and tomatoes.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together the soda water, ferment-jang, lemon juice, and olive oil.",
    "Pour the dressing over the bulgur mixture and toss to combine.",
    "Season with salt to taste.",
    "Cover and refrigerate for at least 30 minutes to allow the flavors to meld."
  ],
